<section id="A8.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.1 </span>Effect of the Temperature in finite-temperature string method</h3>

<figure id="A8.F12" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22122v1/thermal_strings_w_likelihood_class_007_wdos_compressed.png" id="A8.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/116;" width="476" height="116" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span>Effect of temperature <math id="A8.F12.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> on images principal curve. Lower <math id="A8.F12.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> drives paths through cartoonish high-likelihood modes (top); higher <math id="A8.F12.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> preserves realism (bottom).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A8.F13" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22122v1/thermal_strings_w_likelihood_class_024_wdos_compressed.png" id="A8.F13.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/116;" width="476" height="116" alt="Refer to caption">
